## 2. Implemented fix in ai-dev-playbook/scripts/lifecycle.py
- build_plan():
  * Projected records (`records: projected_records`) passed to projected catalog so documents.index_region() generates links to new task paths.
  * All collection indexes in catalog["collections"] inspected:
    - If index does not exist, only created if that collection's documents were in operation.
    - If index exists, checks _collection_index_write with projected catalog.
    - If _collection_index_write returns None (region unchanged), manual text is still rewritten with document_links.rewrite.
    - If rewritten != current_text, write is registered in writes[rel] and kind added to touched_kinds.
  * All collection index paths added to input_rels to ensure complete preimage snapshotting.
- run_plan():
  * Collection indexes modified in plan["writes"] added to kinds for staged and final consistency checks.

